  "question": {
    "text": "Let $f(x)=|x-\\alpha|+|x-\\beta|$, where $\\alpha, \\beta$ are the roots of the equation $x^2-3 x+2=0$. Then the number of points in $[\\alpha, \\beta]$ at which $f$ is not differentiable is",
    "image": null
